//@version=6
// stocks-levels v2.0.0-zones — sandbox for major-liquidity zone styles
// Path: indicators/stocks-levels/scripts/v2/stocks_levels.pine
//
// Same as v1, plus a Zone Lab so we can A/B several ways of drawing
// PD / PM / week / month / after-hours as bands instead of a single line.
// v1 stays the published Line-only build.
//
//   PRICE LEVEL    21 levels, each: show / color / thickness / style
//                  Pre-market H/L, Prev day H/L/Open/Close, Current day open,
//                  Prev week H/L, Current week H/L, Prev month H/L,
//                  1st candle H/L, 5 min H/L, 15 min H/L, After-hour H/L
//   PRICE AXIS     per level: show value on the price scale
//   LABEL          per level: on, "display price", text, size, text color, transparent, offset from last bar
//   NO ALERT PERIOD  mute level-cross alerts inside a session (alerts use alert(), 0 plot counts)
//   NEWS TIME LINE vertical line at HH:MM ET each shown day
//   DAILY GAP      box from prior RTH close to today's RTH open, border thickness / color / style, fill
//   A+ TRADE CHECKLIST  table: Index trend, each level or range Above / Inside / Below, VWAP, MA, ADX, RVOL
//   MAJOR ZONES    PD / PM / week / month / after-hours can draw as Line or Zone (cream band)
//   EXTRA          Session VWAP + up to 8 EMAs
//
// "Show Levels on": Last Day draws levels and gap only for the chart's most recent trading day.
// All Days draws each day's own levels. Daily levels are plot() series inside the levels window
// (default 04:00-16:00 ET) so they scroll and zoom with price. Labels sit N bars right of the last bar,
// joined to the last bar by a short connector line in the level's color.
//
// Plot budget (RE10140 limit 64): plot() with input color = 2, line/label/box/table/alert() = 0.
//   23 levels x2 = 46, VWAP 1 x2 = 2, EMAs 8 x2 = 16  ->  64 of 64 (budget is full).
//   To add another plotted level, drop an EMA slot or give something a constant color.

indicator("Stocks Levels — Zone Lab", shorttitle = "SLV-Z", overlay = true,
     max_lines_count = 200, max_labels_count = 100, max_boxes_count = 500)

// =========================================================================
// CONSTANTS
// =========================================================================
DISP_NOAXIS = display.pane + display.status_line + display.data_window
string STY_OPTS_0 = "solid (—)"
string STY_OPTS_1 = "dashed (- -)"
string STY_OPTS_2 = "dotted (...)"

// =========================================================================
// INPUTS — Price Level
// =========================================================================
string G_LVL = "Price Level"
string levelsMode = input.string("Last Day", "Show Levels on", options = ["All Days", "Last Day"], group = G_LVL, display = display.none,
     tooltip = "Last Day: levels, gap and news line only for the chart's most recent trading day. All Days: every day shows its own.")
string tz = input.string("America/New_York", "Timezone", group = G_LVL, display = display.none)
string levelSession = input.session("0400-1600", "Levels window (ET)", group = G_LVL, display = display.none,
     tooltip = "Daily levels start at the window open. On the chart's latest day they continue through after-hours to the current bar; on earlier days (All Days mode) they stop at the window close.")
string pmSession = input.session("0400-0930", "Pre-market session", group = G_LVL, display = display.none)
string ahSession = input.session("1600-2000", "After-hours session", group = G_LVL, display = display.none)

